{
  "_id": "3JmSMLy1lvdLEaLT1BYb3fuPheT",
  "_type": "Docs",
  "_index": "a0V",
  "title": "Frameworks",
  "navigationTitle": "",
  "body": [
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Alinea runs inside your website: the dashboard, the API it talks to and the queries of your pages are all served by the site itself. It supports "
        },
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Next.js",
          "marks": [
            {
              "_type": "link",
              "_id": "3JmSMNMcSzg1gbMYatL5miD17SP",
              "_link": "entry",
              "_entry": "2YWqKUTrANlgEFMyBUEYdih2HpP"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": ", Astro, SvelteKit and Nuxt, and any other Node server through `alinea/server`."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "How it works"
        }
      ],
      "_anchor": "how-it-works"
    },
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Every integration works the same way, only the few lines that connect Alinea to your framework differ:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "bulletList",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "The Alinea CLI reads your `cms.ts` config and generates its types and a SQLite database of your content into the `@alinea/generated` package, which your site queries."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "`alinea dev -- <your dev command>` starts the local dashboard and runs the dev server of your framework with it. Your site serves the dashboard on `adminPath` (`/admin` by default) and proxies it to the Alinea CLI."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "One middleware serves the handler on `handlerUrl`, the media files and the dashboard route, and runs every other request in its own context so queries can see drafts."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "Pages rendered for a preview get a small script that refreshes them as editors type. See "
                },
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "Live previews",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "_type": "link",
                      "_id": "3JmSMPNVC058vYDmGgGkZzUcede",
                      "_link": "entry",
                      "_entry": "2YlBsRF2vZwxcS27oOSJYmQM37q"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "`alinea build -- <your build command>` generates the dashboard into your public folder and the content database, then builds your site."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Pick your framework in the navigation to set it up."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
